      "explanation": [
        {
          "text": "C form at the nut, A form at fret 3, G form at 5, E form at 8, D form at 10 — chapter 1’s own table, arrived at from a completely different direction. The scale you spent this chapter learning in five windows is, on one string, the list of exactly where those windows begin. Option B is the tempting one: there is only one "
